{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628770/extras/steam_gif_zoomed2.gif?t=1745150531\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br>A programming puzzle game where bugs are eating away your code! One problem: YOU CAN'T TYPE. Navigate and run pre-existing lines of code to make your output match the goal! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level of You Are The Code consists of prewritten code. You get to choose which lines to run in order to match the desired output. Each time you move up or down a line, the bugs will advance and try to erase your code! In some cases, maybe that's not such a bad thing...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Placed in the top 2% of the GMTK 2023 Game Jam out of 6700 entries!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20 Levels (for the demo)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy to understand custom programming language, no prior programming knowledge required</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move undo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No time based puzzles, nothing happens unless you make a move</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3628770?t=1745150531","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3628770?t=1745150531","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628770/fb612679a969464b9f02dcfa797c38ba6dde10ab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745150531","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628770/fb612679a969464b9f02dcfa797c38ba6dde10ab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745150531","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628770/extras/steam_gif_zoomed2.gif?t=1745150531\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br>A programming puzzle game where bugs are eating away your code! One problem: YOU CAN'T TYPE. Navigate and run pre-existing lines of code to make your output match the goal! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level of You Are The Code consists of prewritten code. You get to choose which lines to run in order to match the desired output. Each time you move up or down a line, the bugs will advance and try to erase your code! In some cases, maybe that's not such a bad thing...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Placed in the top 2% of the GMTK 2023 Game Jam out of 6700 entries!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20 Levels (for the demo)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy to understand custom programming language, no prior programming knowledge required</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move undo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No time based puzzles, nothing happens unless you make a move</p></li></ul>","developers":["ThinkWithGames"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3333330","name":"You Are The Code"},"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628770/e6b47e4aa8a467f7126ca8be0eec87ba97cb1ac1/header.jpg?t=1745150531","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257121458